# Signing material beyond the *.pfx and *.cer covered above. scripts/sign-local.ps1
# deliberately keeps its test certificate in Cert:\CurrentUser\My and never exports
# one, so these should never appear — which is the point of ignoring them. The repo
# is public.
*.p12
*.crt
*.der
*.pem
*.key
*.snk
